cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SimpleVisualSLAM
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite this repository.
  For reproducibility, include the version (`./build/run_mono --version`) or git commit hash.
type: software
license: BSD-2-Clause
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-04-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rsasaki0109/simple_visual_slam"
url: "https://github.com/rsasaki0109/simple_visual_slam"
abstract: >-
  A compact, readable C++17 visual SLAM stack with optional RGB-D, DL depth (ONNX),
  accelerometer priors, and DBoW2 loop closing, aimed at research and teaching.
keywords:
  - SLAM
  - visual odometry
  - simultaneous localization and mapping
  - robotics
  - computer vision
  - bundle adjustment
authors:
  - name: The SimpleVisualSLAM authors
